  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1111.01 Minimum Wading Pool Dimensions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1111.01 Minimum Wading Pool Dimensions.\n\n(a) The maximum water depth of a wading pool shall be 2 feet measured from the water line.\n\n(b) The floor slope of a wading pool, if any, shall not exceed one foot in 12 feet.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) #8468, eff 11-1-05; ss by #10577, eff 5-1-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100); ss by #13198, eff 5-1-21 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) (formerly Env-Wq 1108.01)",
